				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acer et diligens rerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Univ. 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">antiquitatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Brut. 15, 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjurationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Sull. 30, 85</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A contriver</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Prov. 11, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
